Package: wb-docker-app
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-yaml, docker-compose-plugin
Description: Shared helper for containerized services on Wiren Board controllers
 wb-docker-app is the shared lifecycle helper for Wiren Board docker-based
 service packages. It ships the single templated systemd unit
 wb-docker-app@.service, the wb-docker-app CLI (install/remove/status/logs/
 restart/update/list) and the shell library that service maintainer scripts
 source. The dangerous lifecycle logic (seeding /mnt/data, compose runner,
 systemd wiring, nginx blocks) lives here once and is reused by every service
 package via Depends, refcounted by apt.
